setSupportedProtocol
  ├── when the caller does not have the CONFIG_OPERATOR_ROLE
  │   └── it should revert
  ├── when protocolId is zero
  │   └── it should revert with ParentVault__NoZeroProtocolId
  ├── when removing support for the active strategy protocol
  │   └── it should revert with ParentVault__CannotRemoveActiveProtocol
  ├── when removing support for the pending strategy protocol
  │   └── it should revert with ParentVault__CannotRemovePendingProtocol
  └── when the caller has the CONFIG_OPERATOR_ROLE
      ├── it should set a protocol as supported
      ├── it should set a protocol as unsupported
      └── it should emit a SupportedProtocolSet event
